i>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">|</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">|</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">|</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">|</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nFor the quadratic polynomial <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"233\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D706 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> we have that the discriminant <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"234\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-cal mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c44 TEX-C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">D</mi></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> So, it doesn't have real roots. </p>\n<p>Therefore, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"235\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is not diagonalizable over <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"236\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211D TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n</div></div>",
