    "q-83847": {
      "dom_id": "step-q83847",
      "name": "Question 16",
      "problem": "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \nThe matrix $A$ has eigenvalues ${\\lambda }_{1}=1,$ ${\\lambda }_{2}=2,$ and ${\\lambda }_{3}=3.$\nFind a diagonal matrix $D$ and an invertible matrix $P$ such that $D={P}^{-1}AP.$",
      "worked_solution": "We apply the diagonalization algorithm.\n\n**Step 1.**  Notice that we are already given the eigenvalues of the matrix: \n\n$\\,$ ${\\lambda }_{1}=1,\\,$ ${\\lambda }_{2}=2,\\,$ ${\\lambda }_{3}=3.$ \n\n**Step 2.** Now, we need to find an eigenvector basis of $A.$ Applying our usual method, we get the following.\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{1}=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-I & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-I)x=0$ gives us the eigenvector ${v}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{2}=2,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-2I & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-2I)x=0$ gives us the eigenvector ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{3}=3,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-3I & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-3I)x=0$ gives us the eigenvector ${v}_{3}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].$\n\n**Step 3.** We construct the diagonal matrix $D$ and the invertible matrix $P$ in the usual way, and this gives us the following:\n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}],\\,P=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-83847-a",
